{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHANGE YOUR FORM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/1_Transform.gif?t=1745328324\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A special letter, endowed with a soul, embarks on a journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change your form to move forward: fly, swim, overcome obstacles, and be ready for unexpected encounters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNVEIL SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/4_Cat.gif?t=1745328324\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travelling through unknown worlds, you will find letters that failed to reach their destination. What messages and secrets did they keep? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/3_Gameplay.gif?t=1745328324\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Familiar things appear completely different when viewed from another perspective. For example, from the deck of a tiny paper boat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/features_origami.png?t=1745328324\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2043 Transform your form, discovering new abilities that help you travel through this magic world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2043 Unveil the secrets of lost messages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2043 See ordinary things from an unusual perspective</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2043 Immerse yourself in a my